Subject: [PATCH 5/7] packaging: add the Omarchy Caihong composition

Add the omarchy-caihong package: lifecycle hooks for boot, system, user, update, provisioning and reset; Hyprland and SDDM configuration; the uwsm environment; and the native package builder.
---
